@@ -303,6 +303,32 @@ input value.
 | `${env:VAR}` | Env variable (required) |
 | `${env:VAR:default}` | Env variable with fallback |
 | `${file:path.json}` | Load file content |
+| `${prompt:path.md}` | Inline a shared prompt fragment |
+
+### Composing Documents
+
+A `.prompty` file can share definitions with the files around it. Paths in
+these features are resolved from the directory that contains the document.
+
+```yaml
+# frontmatter
+base: base.prompty          # inherit defaults from another document
+metadata:
+  tools: !include tools.yaml  # inline a YAML fragment
+```
+
+A line of its own in the markdown body pulls in a shared text partial:
+
+```markdown
+@include "partials/preamble.md"
+```
+
+The body is rendered as a Jinja2 template, so it can also include shared
+template fragments that live beside the document:
+
+```markdown
+{% include "partials/style.md" %}
+```
 
 ### Connection Kinds
 
